  "scope": "Expose glibc endian declarations before system headers in the project-owned Tree-sitter adapter. Existing strict C17/POSIX flags and pinned third-party files retained; Windows/macOS guard excludes change.",
  "production_change": "Define _DEFAULT_SOURCE=1 only on Linux, unless already defined, at the start of app/c_syntax.c before all includes.",
  "cause": "Strict C17 plus explicit POSIX_C_SOURCE hides glibc endian interfaces. The included pinned portable/endian.h selects system endian.h; tree-sitter unicode decoding uses le16toh/be16toh. Clang errors during compile; GCC leaves unresolved calls and fails app link. Local Alpine musl builds did not establish glibc support.",
